---
const GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL='https://github.com/avolaunch/relay-protocol';
const forthcoming=['Protocol specification','Architecture','Schemas','Examples','Reference implementation','Conformance material'];
---
<section id="public-development"><div class="prose-wrap"><div class="section-head"><span class="kicker">Public development</span><h2>Built in the open, from the start</h2></div><p>Relay's design history and ongoing protocol work live on GitHub, including the design notes behind the ideas on this page.</p><p class="forthcoming-label">The following are forthcoming, not available yet:</p><ul class="forthcoming-list">{forthcoming.map((item)=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><div class="button-row"><a class="btn is-secondary" href={GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the repository</a></div></div></section>
<style>.forthcoming-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--text-faint);margin-bottom:1rem}.forthcoming-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.forthcoming-list li{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--text-dim);padding-left:1.1rem;position:relative}.forthcoming-list li::before{content:'—';position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--text-faint)}</style>
